        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ugly Kid Joe\n- Groups: The 2 Live Crew\n- Products: As Ugly as They Wanna Be, As Nasty as They Wanna Be, Shake a Lil' Somethin', \"Everything About You\"\n- Topics: album parody relationships\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, The 2 Live Crew released the album As Nasty as They Wanna Be.\n- In 1991, Ugly Kid Joe released the album As Ugly as They Wanna Be.\n- The 1991 Ugly Kid Joe album As Ugly as They Wanna Be includes the song \"Everything About You.\"\n- The Ugly Kid Joe album As Ugly as They Wanna Be is a parody of The 2 Live Crew album As Nasty as They Wanna Be.\n- Shake a Lil' Somethin' is the seventh studio album by The 2 Live Crew.",
